<h1>Leave a review</h1>
<p class="lede">For clients who've already worked with us. Responses are checked before publishing — nothing goes live automatically.</p>

<form action="https://api.web3forms.com/submit" method="POST">
  <input type="hidden" name="access_key" value="9338efc0-195f-47b9-872f-4aca4a58b051">
  <input type="hidden" name="subject" value="New review from tuaccesible.com">
  <input type="hidden" name="from_name" value="tuaccesible.com form">
  <input type="hidden" name="redirect" value="https://tuaccesible.com/en/thank-you/">
  <p class="hp">
    <label for="botcheck">Leave this field empty</label>
    <input type="checkbox" id="botcheck" name="botcheck" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
  </p>

  <p>
    <label for="display-name">Name or initials to publish (required)</label><br>
    <input type="text" id="display-name" name="display_name" required>
  </p>
  <p>
    <label for="service">Service you hired (required)</label><br>
    <select id="service" name="service" required>
      <option value="Express audit">Express audit</option>
      <option value="Site audit">Site audit</option>
      <option value="Corporate workshop">Corporate workshop</option>
      <option value="Full package">Full package</option>
    </select>
  </p>
  <p>
    <label for="clarity">How would you rate the clarity of the report or training?</label><br>
    <select id="clarity" name="clarity_rating">
      <option value="Excellent">Excellent</option>
      <option value="Good">Good</option>
      <option value="Fair">Fair</option>
      <option value="Poor">Poor</option>
    </select>
  </p>
  <p>
    <label for="recommend">Would you recommend us?</label><br>
    <select id="recommend" name="would_recommend">
      <option value="Yes, without hesitation">Yes, without hesitation</option>
      <option value="Yes, with something to improve">Yes, with something to improve</option>
      <option value="No">No</option>
    </select>
  </p>
  <p>
    <label for="comment">Anything else you'd like to share? (optional)</label><br>
    <textarea id="comment" name="comment" rows="5"></textarea>
  </p>

  <p>
    <input type="checkbox" id="consent" name="consent_publicacion" value="Yes" required>
    <label for="consent">I agree to publish this review and the name I wrote above on tuaccesible.com (required)</label>
  </p>

  <div class="form-legal">
    <p>Data protection, in short: tuaccesible uses what you write here to publish your review, always with your permission and after checking it.</p>
    <p>The form is processed by Web3Forms, a provider with servers in the United States. You can withdraw your permission or ask us to delete the review at any time by writing to <a href="mailto:contacto@tuaccesible.com">contacto@tuaccesible.com</a>. Full detail is in the <a href="/en/privacy/">privacy policy</a>.</p>
  </div>

  <button type="submit">Submit review</button>
</form>
